[00:00.60][by:逆来nilai]
[00:48.32]Dogs of war and men of hate
[00:48.32]雇佣兵和讨厌的人
[00:54.04]With no cause we don't discriminate
[00:54.04]我们不歧视任何事物
[00:59.47]Discovery is to be disowned
[00:59.47]没什么新发现
[01:04.99]Our currency is flesh and bone
[01:04.99]我们的货币就是血肉与与硬骨
[01:10.46]Hell opened up and put on sale
[01:10.46]地狱大门的门票开售了
[01:16.35]Gather around and haggle
[01:16.35]簇拥过来讨价还价吧
[01:21.77]For hard cash we will lie and deceive
[01:21.77]有现金我就可以撒谎欺骗
[01:27.50]Even our masters don't know the web we weave
[01:27.50]就算我们的雇主也不知我们在编制怎样的网
[01:33.07]One world it's a battleground
[01:33.07]一个世界，它是个战场
[01:38.64]One world and we will smash it down
[01:38.64]一个世界，我们会摧毁它
[01:44.23]One world One world
[01:44.23]一个世界，一个世界
[01:55.18]Invisible transfers long distance calls
[01:55.18]悄悄的转移，遥远的召唤
[02:00.56]Hollow laughter in marble halls
[02:00.56]大理石大厅里空洞的笑声
[02:06.05]Steps have been taken a silent uproar
[02:06.05]行动已开始，悄悄的骚动
[02:11.73]Has unleashed the dogs of war
[02:11.73]雇佣兵们被释放了
[02:17.39]You can't stop what has begun
[02:17.39]你不能能阻止已经开始的事
[02:22.72]Signed sealed they deliver oblivion
[02:22.72]签名盖章后他们好像被遗忘了
[02:28.52]We all have a dark side to say the least
[02:28.52]我们都有黑暗的一面
[02:34.03]And dealing in death is the nature of the beast
[02:34.03]死亡的交易是野兽的天性
[02:39.90]One world it's a battleground
[02:39.90]一个世界，它是个战场
[02:45.37]One world and we will smash it down
[02:45.37]一个世界，我们会摧毁它
[02:51.12]One world One world
[02:51.12]一个世界，一个世界
[03:00.51]
[04:44.45]The dogs of war won't negotiate
[04:44.45]雇佣兵们可不会协商
[04:50.14]The dogs of war don't capitulate
[04:50.14]雇佣兵们可不会认输
[04:55.68]They will take and you will give
[04:55.68]他们会掠夺，而你只能给予
[05:01.37]And you must die so that they may live
[05:01.37]为了他们的活，你必须死
[05:06.87]You can knock at any door
[05:06.87]你可以敲任何门
[05:12.32]But wherever you go you know they've been there before
[05:12.32]但无论你去哪儿，他们都曾去过
[05:18.20]Well winners can lose and things can get strained
[05:18.20]赢家也会输，事态会紧张
[05:23.41]But whatever you change you know the dogs remain
[05:23.41]但是无论何事改变，雇佣兵都会幸存
